Subject: [PATCH 4/6] fixed pointer 'start' used after 'free'; and calloc
 potential memory leak

---
 src/FrameL.c | 20 ++++++++++++++++++--
 1 file changed, 18 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/FrameL.c b/src/FrameL.c
index 75c645b..c226423 100644
--- a/src/FrameL.c
+++ b/src/FrameL.c
@@ -9,6 +9,7 @@
